      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "This is The Kitchen, a comedy set in the kitchen of Claude Monet, a smart restaurant in Moscow. In this episode, Max and Vika are keeping their romance secret, and the head chef picks a fight with the chef next door over a parking space. We start at the bar, where Nastya has a quiet proposal for Kostya. First the whole thing in the local language, and don't worry if you miss words.",
